s for residents\n\n**Carpet Area:**  \nKalpataru Prive carpet area details are given below:  \n4 BHK - 2682.15 sq.ft.   \n6 BHK - 4504 sq.ft.\n\n**Lifestyle Amenities:**  \nClub House  \nJogging Track  \nKids Play Area  \nSwimming Pool  \nYoga Zone  \nFitness Corner  \nGym\n\n**Facilities:**  \nLift  \nPower Back Up  \nParking  \nSecurity System  \n24\\*7 Water  \nGated Society\n\n**Why to Invest in this Property?**  \nPrime location in Malabar Hill with panoramic city views  \nSpacious 4 BHK and 6 BHK apartments designed for luxury living  \nDeveloped by a reputed builder with a strong track record  \nEquipped with premium lifestyle and recreational amenities  \nHigh potential for appreciation in South Mumbai’s luxury real estate market\n\n**Possession & RERA:**  \nPossession Date: October 2027  \nMahaRERA Registration Number: P51900047321\n\n### Download Brochure\n\n## Pricing of Kalpataru Prive\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n![6+ BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n![6+ BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n\n## Property Features of Kalpataru Prive\n\n### Amenities\n\n![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp)\n![Jogging Track](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0MdcVu1dWQscKGxYPlOEvfKZG17sbpLwkkWHGQus.webp)\n![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp)\n![Swimming Pool](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/SFZjCUNkC7Mx0X3VU5OrVgx4mtJUvqfy